#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-modules/recommonmark.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Recommonmark</application> is now deprecated in favor of <ulink"
" url=\"https://pypi.org/project/myst-parser/\">MyST-Parser</ulink>.  For "
"this reason, a lot of tests have to be disabled because they do not pass "
"with recent versions of <application>Sphinx</application>. The installation "
"can be partially tested with the following command:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-modules/recommonmark.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pytest -k 'not (test_integration or test_code or test_headings or"
" test_image or test_links or test_lists)'</userinput>"
msgstr ""

